# 📌 What is Spread Operator?

### Definition (English)

The **Spread Operator (`...`)** expands an array or object into individual elements.

### সংজ্ঞা (বাংলা)

**Spread Operator (`...`)** একটি Array বা Object-এর সব Element বা Property-কে আলাদা আলাদা করে ছড়িয়ে দেয়।

---

# 💻 Syntax

```js
...arrayName
```

---

# ✅ Course Example

```js
let numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50];

console.log(...numbers);
```

### Output

```text
10 20 30 40 50
```

---

# 📌 Find Maximum Number

### Without Spread Operator

```js
let maxNumber = Math.max(100, 200, 300, 1000, 50, 670);

console.log(maxNumber);
```

### Output

```text
1000
```

---

### Wrong Way

```js
let numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50];

console.log(Math.max(numbers));
```

### Output

```text
NaN
```

---

### Correct Way

```js
let numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50];

let maxNumber = Math.max(...numbers);

console.log(maxNumber);
```

### Output

```text
50
```

---

# 📌 Find Minimum Number

```js
let numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 2000];

let minNumber = Math.min(...numbers);

console.log(minNumber);
```

### Output

```text
10
```

---

# 📌 Copy Array (Reference Problem)

### Wrong Way

```js
let numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50];

let numbers2 = numbers;

numbers.push(2400);

console.log(numbers2);
```

### Output

```text
[10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 2400]
```

---

### Correct Way

```js
let numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 2000];

let numbers2 = [...numbers, 5000, 24, 5];

console.log(numbers2);
```

### Output

```text
[10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 2000, 5000, 24, 5]
```

---

# 📌 Copy Object

```js
let students = {
  name: "Utsho",
  age: 26
};

let students2 = {
  ...students,
  gpa: "5.00"
};

console.log(students2);
```

### Output

```text
{
  name: "Utsho",
  age: 26,
  gpa: "5.00"
}
```

